		"description": "You can spend a Beastshift charge to awaken the Fungal Guardian within you. You retain your humanoid shape, weapons, and armor, but gain the following: <strong>Fungal Shell.</strong> Gain 10+2xLVL temp HP. Temp HP gained from Fungal Host adds to this tempHP instead of replacing it, though the max can&rsquo;t exceed 10+2xLVL. <strong>Halo of Spores.</strong> Targets of your choice in Reach 2 take KEY Acid damage when they start their turn in the area. Fungal Guardian lasts as long as you have temp HP from Fungal Shell and is considered Beastshifting.",
